# Everything that must not be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Two reasons for each entry: a serverless build has a size ceiling it will
# refuse to cross, and several of these would be a mistake to ship - a test
# database and a directory of other people's uploads are not ours to publish.

# Dependencies and build caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
node_modules/

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.vercel/

# Local database and uploaded media: development data, and not ours to ship.
backend/harmony-dev.db
backend/harmony-dev.db-journal
backend/app/static/uploads/

# Tests are not a deployment artefact, and `backend/tests/conftest.py` holding a
# fixture named `app` is what made Vercel's entrypoint scan ambiguous in the
# first place.
backend/tests/
tools/
frontend/robots.txt
